    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Grimes Clontarf are delighted to bring 77A The Mews, Seaview Avenue North to the market, This is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a 3 bedroom semi-detached property in the heart of Clontarf, that is well-connected to all transport links and local amenities.\r\n\r\nNumber 77A comes to the market in walk-in condition. This well-proportioned property comprises of a total of 102 sq m / 1,097 sq ft of internal living accommodation, The ground floor comprises an entrance hall, WC, living room / dining room and kitchen, While upstairs there are 3 bedrooms and a family bathroom. Parking to the front is off-street parking and there is a south facing walled rear garden. \r\n\r\nSituated in  Clontarf - a mature and settled area, the location is second to none. Clontarf Promenade and cycle track are across the road and both Killester and Clontarf Village with their  excellent selection of restaurants and boutiques are nearby. The area is well- serviced by public transport – there is a quality bus corridor operating along the Clontarf Road providing efficient links to the City Centre. In addition to this, there are an abundance of excellent schools and sporting facilities in the immediate vicinity as well as St. Anne’s Park and Dollymount Strand."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:\r\nWide hallway with laminate flooring and understairs storage press\r\nWC:\r\nWith WC and wash hand basin\r\nLiving Room / Dining Room:\r\nLarge bright room with box bay window and ample living and dining space. Sliding doors to rear\r\nKitchen:\r\nModern kitchen fitted with wall and floor units and tiled flooring. Integrated double oven, induction hob and extractor fan. Non-integrated microwave, dishwasher, washing machine, dryer and fridge / freezer\r\nBedroom 1: \r\nA large double bedroom to the front of the property with plush carpet flooring\r\nBedroom 2:\r\nDouble bedroom to rear of the house with laminate flooring\r\nBedroom 3:\r\nSingle room to rear of the house with laminate flooring\r\nFamily Bathroom:\r\nPart tiled with WC, wash hand basin and walk-in electric shower \r\nOutside:\r\nThere is a south-facing walled rear garden and to the front is a driveway for off-street parking. \r\n\r\nServices:\r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nDriveway for off-street parking\r\n\r\nBER Details:\r\nBER: B2\r\nBER No.  110741741\r\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 123.6 kWh/m²/yr\r\n\r\nContents - Included: carpets, blinds, curtains, light fittings, integrated and non-integrated appliances and all standard fixtures and fittings"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "3 bed semi-detached mews home in an ideal location\r\nApprox. 102 sq m / 1,097 sq ft \r\nSouth-facing walled rear garden\r\nDesirable and incredibly well-connected location in Clontarf \r\nClose to a host of amenities and the City Centre"
      },
      {
